<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Paper yr profit rises to NZ$177 mln.</title>
<headline>FCL Paper yr profit rises to NZ$177 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year yr to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   177 vs 172</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 22.6 vs same</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  3.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)			4.45 vs 4.09</p>
<p>    EBIT					   514 vs 485</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				357 vs 319</p>
<p>    Tax					    109 vs 22</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation tax credit credits</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 6</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Ex div   Oct 29</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Challenge Paper Division Ltd is the pulp and paper division of Fletcher Challenge Ltd. Analysts expected FCL Paper to report net earnings of around NZ$190 million.</p>
</text>
